{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100358","id":2233741450,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6FJDCK","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100358","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100358.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100358.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100358","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100358/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100358/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100358/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c8d7511f227904f8816e4017b3e4e06ab916b376","number":100358,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize `StringName` by storing `Span<char>` instead of `const char *` for static C strings.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This avoids needless repeated `strlen` calls for simple operations on `StringName`, and will enable further optimizations in follow-up PRs.\r\n\r\nThe `PR` also adds the `String::ascii` factory method for `String` which constructs the string from a known-length `ascii` string. No implementation is needed for this constructor since it merely calls the appropriate `copy_from`.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\nI tested one of the most affected beneficiaries, which is `operator[]` since it called `strlen` to verify the index. `string_name[x]` now runs at complexity `O(1)` instead of `O(n)`, which can lead to a 4x speed up for one arbitrary long StringName actually used in the codebase:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\tStringName test = StaticCString::create(\"node_configuration_warning_changed\");\r\n\r\n\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < 100000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\tchar32_t c = test[5];\r\n\t}\r\n\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis yields\r\n- `452ms` for `master` (ba2c5c1e6196b774d55baa45de54aab530db08e9)\r\n- `114ms` for this PR (487cc07c67b24593ffbd3211b0879d3142346bcd)\r\n\r\nOther beneficiaries are (currently) `length()`, `operator String()` and the `StaticCString` constructor, which can now (sometimes) be evaluated for length at compile time rather than needing to call `strlen`.\r\n\r\n## Discussion\r\nFuture PRs should address other functions like `operator==` and `AlphCompare`, as well as the `const char *` constructor, which could be accelerated by using the known length.\r\nA future PR could also accelerate `D_METHODP` by taking `StaticCString` instead of `const char*` as arguments, so the `strlen` can be evaluated at compile time there too.\r\n\r\nIt might be good to store `String` instead of `Span<char>`, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11517. This would partially supersede this PR.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-12-13T12:35:00Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T22:43:56Z","closed_at":"2025-04-23T22:31:27Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Ivorforce:stringname-strrange","ref":"stringname-strrange","repo":{"id":861387944,"node_id":"R_kgDOM1e8qA","name":"godot","full_name":"Ivorforce/godot","owner":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organization